      "content": "it's not even about finding something real anymore. it's just that the weight is too much. if i'm not even a real person, then what's the point of even carrying this body around? it feels like i'm just a ghost haunting a shell that doesn't belong to me. wouldn't it be easier to just... stop? to just let the light fade and not have to pretend anymore?",
